  "name": "Wayuu",
  "variant": "Wayuunaiki",
  "region": "La Guajira Peninsula (Colombia and Venezuela)",
  "summary": "An Arawakan language of the Wayuu people, on the La Guajira Peninsula, between Colombia and Venezuela. Its speakers call it wayuunaiki, «the language of the people».",
